ines. The active line uses a function to identify and highlight the focused snippet, while others use standard syntax highlighting.  The teaching code box uses the same highlighting method, creating a consistent visual experience.  I will now check `styles.css` to verify the application of the custom style.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"Select-String -Path \\\"app_build\\\\styles.css\\\" -Pattern \\\"thonny-token-box\\\" -Context 2, 12\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CVT\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\code-flow-visualizer\"","IsDaemon":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Checking thonny-token-box in styles.css\"","toolSummary":"\"Check thonny-token-box in styles.css\""}}]}
